{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在音乐细节和情绪微变化的呈现上明显不如X，尤其削弱了音型、音色、力度起伏与人物感受之间的细致对应。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"平\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y最大的优势是把人物的念头、行为和顾虑连成了清楚的因果关系，尤其S05、S08—S14的心理转折更容易理解，前后也更像一条完整的心路。X的加亮关键词更方便瞬间抓取重点，音乐感受也更细腻具体，但部分感受词堆叠过多，需要观众自行拼接，容易让情绪细节盖过叙事。综合边听边看的体验，我更倾向Y，虽然它牺牲了一部分X所具有的音乐细节颗粒度。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "39536fb6-7862-4064-8a3c-2587698c5332", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T223700827836Z", "elapsed_seconds": 57.188, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:37:58.036627+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6da46cda6fab775cb3dfa72d51ef6afbbc7caad9ca4f1294f66033d93fe0ea4b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py